1
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,250
Heel and toe and watch us glide,

2
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:25,820
Catch the spark across the floor!

3
00:00:25,969 --> 00:00:28,379
Throw the cage and rules aside,

4
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:31,050
Hear the gilded ballroom roar!

5
00:00:31,199 --> 00:00:33,719
Spin me round, don't let me go,

6
00:00:33,869 --> 00:00:36,259
Fire flying off the shoe!

7
00:00:36,409 --> 00:00:38,920
Let the shining parquet glow,

8
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:42,450
Nothing left but me and you!

9
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:25,049
Past the tables, past the crowd,

10
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,719
Slicing through the amber light!

11
00:01:27,870 --> 00:01:30,310
Laughing wild and singing loud,

12
00:01:30,459 --> 00:01:32,980
We are kings and queens tonight!

13
00:01:33,129 --> 00:01:35,620
Spin me round, don't let me go,

14
00:01:35,769 --> 00:01:38,209
Fire flying off the shoe!

15
00:01:38,359 --> 00:01:40,819
Let the shining parquet glow,

16
00:01:40,969 --> 00:01:44,280
Nothing left but me and you!

17
00:02:14,449 --> 00:02:16,849
Crimson satin takes the air,

18
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,460
Every step a lightning strike!

19
00:02:19,610 --> 00:02:22,060
Leave the ghosts of our despair,

20
00:02:22,210 --> 00:02:24,750
Never seen a couple like!

21
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:27,379
Spin me round, don't let me go,

22
00:02:27,530 --> 00:02:29,979
Fire flying off the shoe!

23
00:02:30,062 --> 00:02:32,543
Let the shining parquet glow,

24
00:02:32,636 --> 00:02:36,326
Nothing left but me and you!

